Third-party material in the baud-domain crate

The licence of baud-domain is LICENSE. This file lists the material from
other projects that files in this crate carry: for each, the files by their
paths in this crate, the licence it keeps, and where the notice that licence
asks for is. It is generated from baud's record of third-party files, in its
repository at https://github.com/baud-terminal/baud, whose THIRD_PARTY.md
lists every such file there.

The Xcms colour conversions in xcms.rs (u'v'Y, xyY, TekHVC and the TekHVC
gamut clip), ported from libX11's Xcms, and in its test module the Tektronix
CRT data and table search of LRGB.c. As the TekHVC notice asks, that notice
is reproduced in xcms.rs; baud displays no TekHVC coordinates, since a
TekHVC colour is read, drawn as sRGB and reported as rgb; and baud calls
